         <dc:description>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Features&#xD;&#xA;â€¢â€‡25 V, 0.22 A Continuous, 0.5 A Peak&#xD;&#xA;â™¦â€‡RDS(on) = 5 Î© @ VGS = 2.7 V&#xD;&#xA;â™¦â€‡RDS(on) = 4 Î© @ VGS = 4.5 V&#xD;&#xA;â€¢â€‡Very Low Level Gate Drive Requirements Allowing Direct Operation in 3â€‰V Circuits. VGS(th) &lt; 1.5 V&#xD;&#xA;â€¢â€‡Gate-Source Zener for ESD Ruggedness. &gt;6 kV Human Body Model&#xD;&#xA;â€¢â€‡This is a Pb-Free and Halide Free Device</rdf:li>
            </rdf:Alt>
